# Staged at image build time (see ../README.md "Staging the DDA Triton
# conversion resources"): the python-backend model templates and app
# packages from src/backend that harness/model_staging.py copies into
# each staged Triton model repository entry. The image builds with this
# directory empty; model staging then fails at runtime with a clear
# per-node error instead of a Triton crash.
